<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kirgiz GDP rises 7.3 pct in Jan-Oct.</title>
<headline>Kirgiz GDP rises 7.3 pct in Jan-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's gross domestic product in the first ten months of this year was 7.3 percent higher than in the same period a year earlier, the National Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ GDP		    Jan-Oct 96 Jan-Sept 96 Jan-Oct 95</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change    +7.3	 +3.0	  -5.1</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
